\\footnotesize\
\\textit\{Notes:\}\
$k$ indexes window specifications.\
$P_\{0,k\}$ uses the reference hardware classification,\
whereas $P^\{*\}_\{0,k\}$ additionally updates the ETC classification.\
$\\mathcal B_\{\\mathrm\{ref\}\}$ is the fixed reference four-chain budget,\
and $\\mathcal B_k$ uses window-specific mean daily revenues.\
The isolated analysis contains 240 specifications;\
the synchronized and reclassified analyses contain 180\
because the earliest requested windows lack complete\
ETHW revenue coverage.\
